'''Vars''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]] event. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update|Version 2.2]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]] increases health, attack power and range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 8.2 Update|Version 8.2]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]].

